    {
      "text": "If static electricity builds in its body, its fleece doubles in volume. Touching it will shock you.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its fleece grows continually. In the summer, the fleece is fully shed, but it grows back in a week.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It stores lots of air in its soft fur, allowing it to stay cool in summer and warm in winter.",
      "version": "crystal"
